## chart primary-flows Primary Barter Flows
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  buyer["Neighbor claimer"]:::gray
  maker["Neighbor maker"]:::gray
  wallet["GREEN GET wallet auto-provisions credit account"]:::green
  buy["GREEN POST credits purchase creates Stripe Checkout session"]:::green
  webhook["GREEN POST credits webhook idempotently mints purchase credits"]:::green
  discover["GREEN discovery returns category credit_cost tags reputation add-ons"]:::green
  order["GREEN POST orders snapshots credit_cost and selected add-ons"]:::green
  claim["GREEN POST orders claim atomically debits spend ledger"]:::green
  ready["GREEN maker confirm-ready claimed to ready"]:::green
  handoff["GREEN both parties confirm hand-off before completed"]:::green
  settle["GREEN maker earns credits through append-only earn entry"]:::green
  dispute["GREEN disputed order resolves with refund_credit only"]:::green
  review["GREEN completed or delivered order allows two-way review"]:::green
  nofiat["GREEN no payout withdrawal or negative purchase path"]:::green

  buyer --> wallet --> buy --> webhook --> discover --> order --> claim
  maker --> discover
  claim --> ready --> handoff --> settle --> review
  claim --> dispute --> nofiat
  webhook --> nofiat

  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart lifecycle Credit Claim Lifecycle
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: POST /v1/orders
  draft --> claimed: GREEN claim debit spend ledger
  claimed --> ready: GREEN maker confirms ready
  ready --> handed_off: GREEN pickup hand-off confirmed
  ready --> delivered: GREEN delivery confirmed
  handed_off --> completed: GREEN both parties confirmed
  delivered --> completed: GREEN both parties confirmed
  completed --> reviewed: GREEN review direction recorded
  claimed --> disputed: GREEN either participant disputes
  ready --> disputed: GREEN either participant disputes
  handed_off --> disputed: GREEN either participant disputes
  delivered --> disputed: GREEN either participant disputes
  disputed --> refunded_credit: GREEN admin resolves credit refund only
  draft --> canceled
  claimed --> canceled
  completed --> [*]
  reviewed --> [*]
  refunded_credit --> [*]

  note right of claimed
    GREEN: claim creates spend ledger entry
    Tests: test_order_claim.py and test_fulfillment_lifecycle_proving.py
  end note
  note right of completed
    GREEN: maker settlement creates earn ledger entry exactly once
    Tests: test_order_handoff.py
  end note
  note right of refunded_credit
    GREEN: refunds credits only, never fiat
    Tests: test_order_disputes.py
  end note
```

